  "details": "It would be really great if we could customize the appearance. For example. the Mod client EMMVRC made it possible to change the default build color if the ui elements to what ever color the user wants\n\nmany programs have implemented these features due to user preferences and to help / guid visually limited people\n\nfor example someone that has problems with fading vision could make / get / use a customized ui with hight contrast and sharp outlining. so even with blurry vision it's possible to recognize the shape of ui elements\n\n(make the ui elements sprites available so users can make new custom sprites)",
